[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3 uid="uid://unitremotetransform3dloc"]

; The one variable: use_global_coordinates is false on a relay under a parent at x +3. A 3D relay in
; local coordinates pushes when its own local transform changes, which a load does not do (measured
; on Godot 4.6.3), so the box stays at x -2. Every other RemoteTransform golden relays in global
; coordinates, so none of them shows a regression in it.

